    "type": "Table",
    "diagnosis": "",
    "title": "<p>Comparison of cell block preparatory methods</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "Deepali Jain",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 697.65pt; margin-left: -.25pt; border-collapse: collapse;\" border=\"0\" width=\"930\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 99.5pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"133\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black;\">Type of method </span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 163.0pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"217\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black;\">Practical use</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 205.55pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"274\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black;\">Advantages</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 229.6pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"306\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black;\">Shortcomings </span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 99.5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"133\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Clot and scrape </strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 163.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"217\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Where there is no provision for other cell block methods</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Highly cellular FNAB material</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 205.55pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"274\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Inexpensive</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">No set-up or equipment required</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 229.6pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"306\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Not applicable to all types of samples</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">No uniform cellularity</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Scraping induces crushing of cells</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 99.5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"133\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black;\">Simple sedimentation</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 163.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"217\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Highly cellular exudative fluids</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 205.55pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"274\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Inexpensive</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black;\">No expertise required</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Easy to perform</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 229.6pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"306\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Not applicable to all types of samples</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Breakage of frail sediment during processing</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Variable cellularity </span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 99.5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"133\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Plasma thrombin </strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 163.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"217\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Any type of FNAB and fluid</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 205.55pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"274\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Simple</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Low cost, high user satisfaction</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Compatible with ICC and molecular testing</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 229.6pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"306\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Cross-contamination from donor plasma and <a name=\"_Hlk116560370\"></a>thromboplastin, which interferes in molecular testing</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 99.5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"133\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black;\">Agar-based and collodion bag</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 163.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"217\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Any type of FNAB and fluid</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 205.55pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"274\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Compatible with ICC and molecular testing</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 229.6pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"306\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Agar and collodion handling is a cumbersome process and needs technical expertise for correct proportion and temperature for satisfactory cell block making</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 99.5pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"133\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Automated (Cellient)</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 163.0pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"217\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Scant&nbsp;/ sparsely cellular specimens</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 205.55pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"274\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Fully automated</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Free from cross-contamination of manual methods</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Good-quality nucleic acid yield for molecular testing</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 229.6pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"306\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">High cost</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Only specimens collected in methanol-based fixatives can be used</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Technical expertise needed for cutting thin sections from cell blocks</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Some antibodies do not work because of alcohol fixation</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>",
